# Match 3 camera layout (locked)

Camera **id = filename** (see `match_raw_camera_ids`). This rule is about **where** each cam sits and how the coach mosaic is arranged. Do not “fix” the mosaic by guessing FOV.

## Pitch 1 axes (reminder)

Origin = centre. **+x north (P6)**, **−x south (P1)**. **+y left**, **−y right** from P1 looking north. Not FIFA 105×68.

## Physical placement (diagram chips)

Around Pitch 1 (landmark dashboard / `CAM_XY`):

| Cam | Side of pitch | Notes |
|-----|---------------|--------|
| **P1** | South end | End-line / Goal 1 |
| **P6** | North end | End-line / Goal 2 |
| **P10** | South–**left** | Quad, +y |
| **P7** | South–**right** | Quad, −y |
| **P8** | North–**right** | Quad, −y (mount verified 2026-03) |
| **P9** | North–**left** | Quad, +y (mount verified 2026-03) |
| **P_Goal1** | Near Goal 1 | |
| **P_Goal2** | Near Goal 2 | |

Compass shorthand on the diagram: **LEFT = P10 · P9**, **RIGHT = P7 · P8**.

Code/docs: `reports/eval_match3/landmark_dashboard/index.html`, `docs/product/MATCH3_CAPTURE.md`.

## WHOLE PITCH mosaic (coach UI) — compass rotated 90° CW

Locked in `src/review/cam_mosaic.py`. Labels: **Left** top · **Right** bottom · **South** left · **North** right.

```
        LEFT
   P10  |  P9
 SOUTH  |  NORTH
   P7   |  P8
        RIGHT
```

| Cell | Camera | Rotate |
|------|--------|--------|
| Top left | **P10** | **180°** |
| Top right | **P9** | **180°** |
| Bottom left | **P7** | none |
| Bottom right | **P8** | none |

Pitch panel below uses matching `map_orient=cw90` (goals on short edges, south left / north right).

### Do / don't

- **Do** keep `QUAD_GRID = [["P10","P9"],["P7","P8"]]` and `QUAD_ROTATE_180 = {P10, P9}`.
- **Do** keep mosaic **defish ON** for P7–P10 (see `match3_defish`).
- **Don't** remap video files to different cells — fix labels/rotation only.
- **Don't** default review defish to OFF.

P7–P10 fisheye/defish: `match3_defish` rule + `docs/product/MATCH3_DEFISH.md`.
